    <title>春养肝气 顺时安康 从吃时令菜开始~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ca43ace2c8be3155e70610</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ca43ace2c8be3155e70610</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近是不是总觉得睡不醒、皮肤干、莫名想发脾气？明明春天万物复苏，身体却像“掉了链子”？别急，这其实是身体在提醒你：该“顺时养肝”啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期【素问素答】，我们邀请到老朋友——中国中医科学院博士研究生袁国兴大夫，跟着袁大夫抓住春季养生的黄金期，让肝气舒展，精神饱满地迎接整个春天！</span></p><span></span><p><span>⌚️时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>春季养生最核心的重点是养肝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>春季养肝，不要损耗阳气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>现代人养生，建议少吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>多吃时令食物，感受四季的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>春天能不能多吃一点酸的东西?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>手脚冰凉，未必是寒，可能是肝气不舒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>一年四季都能运动，运动能让人流动起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>春天万物复苏，为什么会情志郁结呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>过敏，本质上要增强免疫力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>肝和脾胃是相互制约的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>养生，是一件细水长流的事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>袁国兴：中国中医科学院博士研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️本期主播/策划制作与剪辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>可心&amp;七七</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻你可以在以下平台同步收听“素问素答”</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 苹果播客 | 荔枝 | 蜻蜓 | 网易云音乐 | QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：素问素答</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵背景音乐：Romantic (Royalty Free Music) - "ROMANTIC DAY" by Alex Productions （Breaking Copyright）</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️友情提示：我们是一档关注身心自在的小节目，不是、也不能替代医疗建议哦，特殊情况请遵医嘱，如有不适请及时线下就医。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入听友群，一起养生吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>也可添加VX：suwensuda ，备注“听友群”加入群聊。</span></p>]]></description>
