    <title>秋冬来临，谁来拯救我的鼻子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ef67e92265473020a05817</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ef67e92265473020a05817</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Oct 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一到秋冬，很多人的鼻子就开始频频“闹脾气”：干燥发痒、内部结痂，或是喷嚏不止、清涕不断，呼吸之间都带着不适……鼻炎是肺的问题吗？“春夏养阳，秋冬养阴”，对于鼻子不舒服的人来说，秋冬季节的养护重点是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们邀请到袁国兴大夫，请他为大家支支招——如何运用中医的智慧，从内而外帮鼻子安然过冬～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⌚️</span></strong><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a>鼻炎的季节特征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a>肺开窍于鼻 中医如何看待鼻炎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a>简单自测鼻炎类型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a>鼻子难受时，这几个方法能让你立刻舒服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a>按揉这些穴位，缓解鼻炎不适</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a>鼻炎的秋冬养护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a>鼻炎到底能不能治愈？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a>突然开始过敏，可能是你的体质变差了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a>千万别试！脱敏实验可能有生命危险</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️</span></strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>袁国兴：中国中医科学院博士研究生</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️</span></strong><span>本期主播／策划制作</span></p><span></span><p><span>小晃、七七</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📻</span></strong><span>你可以在以下平台同步收听“素问素答”</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 苹果播客 | 荔枝 | 蜻蜓 | 网易云音乐 | QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵</span></strong><span>背景音乐：Romantic (Royalty Free Music) - "ROMANTIC DAY" by Alex Productions （Breaking Copyright）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⚠️</span></strong><span>友情提示：我们是一档关注身心自在的小节目，不是也不能替代医疗建议哦，特殊情况请遵医嘱，如有不适请及时线下就医。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎加入听友群，一起养生吧！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>也可添加VX：suwensuda ，备注“听友群”加入群聊。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.