    <title>春困没精神，武当三丰派传人教你练八段锦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ac51935e6f58876ddecbf0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ac51935e6f58876ddecbf0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Feb 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春天来了，不知道听友们会不会和我们一样，总感觉有些春困、乏力、懒懒的、没精气神儿……</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，是时候开始练八段锦了！这套古老而完整的健身功法，不需要器械，又不受场地限制，动作柔和且相对简单，只要坚持练习，相信一定能帮助你生发阳气，调理气血，畅通经脉，让身体越来越轻盈而有力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>去年，小晃去北京白云观学习过道家传统八段锦（八段锦有很多版本，但很多理念是相通的）。今天的节目，我们就把当时在白云观教学的老师请过来啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于八段锦练习中的疑问：怎么配合呼吸？呼吸做反怎么办？什么时间适宜练习？频率及频次……还有各种需要注意的细节，我们一次聊个明白。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📒时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 八段锦逐步在年轻人中流行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 资由老师护发“秘诀”：多练功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 小晃分享在北京白云观学习八段锦的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a> 八段锦为什么叫八段锦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 道家八段锦的核心精神：长生久视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a> 长期练习八段锦的益处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 推荐练习的频率、频次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 哪些人适合练习，哪些人不适合练习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 什么是排病反应？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 呼吸在八段锦中的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 练习过程中如何加入“意念”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 一天当中什么时间练习最好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a> 容易被忽视，却需要注意的小细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a> 资由老师分享习武经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 在一遍遍重复练习中领悟到的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1427">23:47</a> 推荐给忙碌打工人更好的休息方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 听友群问题答疑，这些细节需注意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 练习什么不重要，重要的是要坚持练习</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️本期嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>资由:武当武术主教官，武当三丰派第十六代传人。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️本期主播／🖥️策划制作</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>坚持练功的【小晃】</span></p><span></span><p><span>积极行动的【花椒】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📻你可以在以下平台同步收听“素问素答”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 苹果播客 | 荔枝 | 蜻蜓 | 网易云音乐 | QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🍠小红书：</span></strong><span>素问素答</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵背景音乐：</span></strong><span>Romantic (Royalty Free Music) - "ROMANTIC DAY" by Alex Productions （Breaking Copyright）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⚠️友情提示：</span></strong><span>我们是一档关注身心自在的小节目，不是也不能替代医疗建议哦，特殊情况请遵医嘱，如有不适请及时线下就医。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎加入听友群，一起养生吧！</span></strong><span>也可添加VX：suwensuda ，备注“听友群”加入群聊。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoAwqIcLciU4l3H7wDFZrF7hDIYp.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
